> "Could not find artifact com.sun:tools:jar:11.0.27 at specified path /usr/lib/jvm/java-11-openjdk-amd64/../lib/tools.jar"
> 
> This error occurs because:
> 1. The project was designed for Java 7 (as specified in .travis.yml: oraclejdk7, openjdk7)
> 2. The current environment uses Java 11
> 3. In Java 9+, the tools.jar file was removed from the JDK
> 4. The compile-testing library (versions 0.6, 0.7, 0.8) has a transitive dependency on com.sun:tools
