> - service/pom.xml: uses compile-testing 0.6
> - value/pom.xml: uses compile-testing 0.6
> 
> === SOLUTION ===
> Update compile-testing to version 0.19 which is compatible with Java 11+.
> This version doesn't require tools.jar and works with modern JDKs.
> 
> Also need to update truth dependency to a compatible version (0.42 or later).
> 
> The parent pom.xml also has profiles that reference tools.jar which need to be updated
> to handle Java 9+ environments.
